interior helps keep travel essentials accessible during airport transit, weekend getaways, and short business trips.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_PiTLft":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is U7 a hiking backpack?<\/strong>","text":"<p>It can support light city-outdoor use, but it is not positioned as a technical hiking or expedition pack.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_JQkAN9":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Urban U7 water-resistant?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. The backpack uses water-resistant nylon fabric and premium SBS® zippers to help protect your belongings from light rain, splashes, and daily urban weather conditions.Does not offer full waterproof protection<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_P6HFU9":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Will my laptop fit inside?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The dedicated laptop compartment fits most laptops up to 16 inches, including MacBook Pro 16\", making it suitable for work, study, and digital nomad setups.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_976hp6":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Who is the Urban U7 designed for?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The Urban U7 is built for commuters, students, creators, and professionals who need a lightweight everyday backpack with organized storage for work, study, and weekend activities. Its 18L capacity balances portability and functionality for daily carry.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["question_HL8h6f","question_Wbnd63","question_n3DLkt","question_PiTLft","question_JQkAN9","question_P6HFU9","question_976hp6"],"name":"t:sections.faq.name","settings":{"style":"with-background","heading":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS","heading_size":"title-sm","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","